: "Data defect", "metric": "Opens at the daily low vs high", "value_a": 204.0, "label_a": "Free provider (at low)", "value_b": 82.0, "label_b": "Free provider (at high)", "plain_english": "A one-line check on the data itself (p = 3.7e-13) flags the free feed and none of the six exchange futures series, with 3.3% false alarms across 30 clean three-year windows."}, {"study": "DXY", "theme": "Undeclared search", "metric": "Regime-strategy Sharpe as reported vs deflated Sharpe after declaring 216 configurations", "value_a": 0.72, "label_a": "Reported", "value_b": 0.613, "label_b": "Deflated Sharpe (needs > 0.95)", "plain_english": "A strategy first reported at 0.79 drops to 0.72 after a code fix and fails every correction once all 216 variants that were tried are counted."}, {"study": "DXY", "theme": "Honest search", "metric": "Best Sharpe of 1,312 configurations vs mean luck ceiling (2,000 bootstrap runs)", "value_a": 0.653, "label_a": "Best real", "value_b": 0.737, "label_b": "Luck ceiling (mean of 2,000 runs)", "plain_english": "Re-running the whole 1,312-strategy search on 2,000 resampled versions of the data, the real best sits at the 23rd percentile of what luck alone produces (p = 0.77)."}, {"study": "DXY", "theme": "Carry", "metric": "Carry Sharpe: futures (roll signal) vs 24-year spot total return", "value_a": 0.377, "label_a": "Futures 2011-2025", "value_b": 0.019, "label_b": "Spot total return 2002-2026", "plain_english": "An apparent carry reversal was mostly a missing interest term; neither version beats its own luck ceiling (p 0.21 and 0.40)."}, {"study": "COMMODITIES", "theme": "Momentum", "metric": "Best momentum-spread Sharpe vs median best under random ranking", "value_a": 0.46962804037784434, "label_a": "Best real", "value_b": 0.41195097926788093, "label_b": "Random ranking (median best)", "plain_english": "Buying recent winners and selling recent losers does no better than a random ranking in a search this size."}, {"study": "COMMODITIES", "theme": "